{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今日（25日）適逢中秋佳節，視后龔嘉欣在社交平台發放一組充滿節日色彩的唯美打卡靚相應節！她特意前往元朗大橋街市著名的「燈籠街」，置身於五彩繽紛的傳統手工燈籠海之中，並感性留言：「迎月 將迎來圓滿 祝中秋快樂 人月團圓💕」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fd3a460e-b7fa-4287-905d-56f60f7f3945.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026hX1NTpXIIP1790317223.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fd3a460e-b7fa-4287-905d-56f60f7f3945.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中可見，龔嘉欣身穿一襲純白蕾絲花邊荷葉袖上衣，搭配米白色長褲，整體造型簡約清新，散發出滿滿的少女感。置身於掛滿金魚、飛機及各式繽紛花燈的狹長燈籠街中，龔嘉欣玩心大發，擺出多個俏皮又甜美的打卡 Pose。她時而蹲在燈籠通道中央回眸甜笑，時而輕輕觸摸懸掛的燈籠流蘇，笑容極具感染力。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a4a1a453-2f4d-41f0-ab77-0cd29071144e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Cx1y1xuHLG1790317223.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a4a1a453-2f4d-41f0-ab77-0cd29071144e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當中最吸睛的，莫過於其中一張合照——龔嘉欣捧著一隻精緻的黃色傳統金魚燈籠，興緻勃勃地模仿金魚燈籠的表情，對著鏡頭特意做出「嘟嘴」賣萌的可愛表情！這一幕既鬼馬又嬌俏，瞬間融化了大批網民與粉絲的心。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T06:58:40.257551+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}